<title>USA: St. Joseph Cty, Mich., won by First of America.</title>
<headline>St. Joseph Cty, Mich., won by First of America.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>First of America Securities Inc. said it won $1.640 million of St. Joseph Cty, Mich., sewage disposal system limited tax bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.01 percent.</p>
</text>
